  "name": "Beef, Mushroom, and Marsala Stroganoff with Herbed Mash",
  "subtitle": "Creamy mushroom stroganoff served over buttery herb mash",
  "description": "A savory beef and mushroom sauce enriched with Marsala, mustard, and cream, paired with soft mashed potatoes and fresh herbs.",
